><mxPoint x="120" y="500"/></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_note" value="&lt;b&gt;읽는 법&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• 서버는 모든 차에 같은 카드를 보낸다. 누가 받았는지 모른다&lt;br&gt;• 차는 프로필별로 무엇을 보여 줬고 확인했는지 기록한다&lt;br&gt;• 빨간 점선 = 차 밖으로 나가는 데이터. 프로필 ID · 위치 · 질문 원문은 없다&lt;br&gt;• 번호 ①~⑦ 은 다음 페이지의 자세한 흐름" style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=light-dark(#fffbe6,#3a3520);strokeColor=#d6b656;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="230" width="440" height="190" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg" value="범례" style="rounded=0;html=1;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=10;fontStyle=1;fontSize=12;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#999999;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="460" width="440" height="160" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg0" value="" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;fillColor=light-dark(#d5e8d4,#1f3b1f);strokeColor=#82b366;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1620" y="490" width="50" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg0t" value="시작 · 끝" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1680" y="490" width="140" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg1" value="" style="rounded=0;fillColor=light-dark(#dae8fc,#1d3a5c);strokeColor=#6c8ebf;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1830" y="490" width="50" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg1t" value="처리" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1890" y="490" width="140" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg2" value="" style="shape=rhombus;perimeter=rhombusPerimeter;fillColor=light-dark(#e1d5e7,#3b2a45);strokeColor=#9673a6;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1620" y="530" width="40" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="p0_lg2t" value="판단" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><